<div class="titleOutBox"><div class="titleBox">
<h1><pre>※※※受限制的存取頁面※※※</pre></h1>
</div></div>

<div class="Box">
<pre class="Text">!!! 安全警示：網站已被封鎖 !!!

您嘗試造訪的網站已被偵測為惡意或高風險網站
（例如：漏洞利用 Exploit / 惡意軟體 Malware / 網路釣魚 Phishing / 劫持 Hijacking / 殭屍網路 Botnet / 未分配的 IP 位址 Unassigned IP），
為確保資訊安全，系統已自動封鎖該連線。

請立即停止存取並檢查您的資訊設備。
任何試圖繞過封鎖的行為將被記錄並可能導致帳號或網路權限停用。

如您認為此網站為誤判，請聯絡資訊單位協助查驗。
服務信箱：cc@mail.mcut.edu.tw

~明志科大電算中心

==================================================================================================================

!!! SECURITY ALERT: SITE BLOCKED !!!

The site you attempted to visit has been detected as malicious or high-risk
(e.g., Exploit / Malware / Phishing / Hijacking / Botnet / Unassigned IP).
To ensure information security, the system has automatically blocked this connection.

Please stop attempting to access it immediately and check your information devices.
Any attempt to bypass this block will be logged and may result in account suspension or revocation of network access.

If you believe this is a false positive, please contact the IT/security unit for verification.
Support email: cc@mail.mcut.edu.tw

~MCUT Computer Center</pre><br><br>
